{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40861","headline":"春草凝露 · 张友正","name":"春草凝露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍苍芳草色，含露对青春。\n已赖阳和长，仍慙润泽频。\n日临残未滴，风度欲成津。\n蕙叶垂偏重，兰丛洗转新。\n将行愁裛迳，欲采畏濡身。\n独爱池塘畔，清华远袭人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张友正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}